WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.860 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:36.550
THE BOY FROM SHANGRI-LA

00:02:16.620 --> 00:02:19.430
That's the Argama!
The actual Argama!

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:23.440
Why didn't you give us
an immediate answer?

00:02:23.440 --> 00:02:26.150
Well, our space port's
pretty full up.

00:02:26.150 --> 00:02:29.440
Please understand. Any nonpaying
work goes to the back of the line.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:31.030
What a colony!

00:02:31.030 --> 00:02:33.620
I'm sick and tired of hearing
the name "Shangri-La"!

00:02:34.260 --> 00:02:35.830
Is Kamille still the same?

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.540
Looks that way.

00:02:56.700 --> 00:02:58.220
'Scuse us.

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:00.230
I thought you two
had disappeared.

00:03:00.230 --> 00:03:02.350
What if Kamille
never gets better?

00:03:02.350 --> 00:03:03.730
He'll be okay.

00:03:03.730 --> 00:03:06.190
We'll be landing
in that colony soon.

00:03:06.190 --> 00:03:08.800
Then we can get
him to a hospital.

00:03:15.880 --> 00:03:18.540
This escape pod should
get us 10,000 gillas!

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:23.920
You did it, Judau.
And without a suit, too!

00:03:23.920 --> 00:03:26.920
I can do a simple job
like this without a suit!

00:03:37.570 --> 00:03:40.350
Once we take care of this,
I'm going out again.

00:03:40.350 --> 00:03:42.420
I found a Hizack!

00:03:42.420 --> 00:03:45.650
The two of us can't handle a Hizack.
Better call Beecha and the others.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:48.520
That's just going to cut
down our percentage.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:50.940
I'm the one who always
does the most work!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.040
This is a primo escape pod!

00:04:09.040 --> 00:04:12.860
Sure! Have I ever found
anything that wasn't good?

00:04:18.860 --> 00:04:20.960
This thing's shiny new, Iino!

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.520
If we get 1000 gilla for it,
that'll be 500 for each of us!

00:04:25.520 --> 00:04:27.520
Nice!

00:04:27.910 --> 00:04:30.650
Hey, this thing's still working.

00:04:30.650 --> 00:04:32.230
Maybe if I do this...?

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:34.610
Huh?

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:35.850
What's wrong?

00:04:43.300 --> 00:04:45.540
It's a surviving pilot.

00:04:45.540 --> 00:04:47.660
We can't take it
to the junkyard now.

00:04:47.660 --> 00:04:51.040
What are you saying?!
We worked hard to bring it in here!

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:52.250
Now what?

00:04:52.250 --> 00:04:54.280
Just dump out the pilot!

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.930
Looks like you two are
trying to make a little profit.

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:02.510
You had nothing to do
with this job, Beecha.

00:05:02.510 --> 00:05:04.470
That's my line.
The deal was that...

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:07.500
we tell each other when
we find salvage out there.

00:05:08.200 --> 00:05:10.590
We're taking that.

00:05:11.790 --> 00:05:14.110
No fair! Wait!

00:05:14.110 --> 00:05:17.200
You break the deal,
you pay the price, right?

00:05:17.200 --> 00:05:19.360
At least you gotta
pay us our share!

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:20.870
Beecha!

00:05:20.870 --> 00:05:22.660
Then, you can take it.

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.660
You should know when to quit.

00:05:34.400 --> 00:05:36.050
Where am I?

00:05:36.050 --> 00:05:39.840
Shangri-La! Side 1!

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:42.700
Shangri-La?

00:05:45.570 --> 00:05:48.230
And who are you?

00:05:48.230 --> 00:05:50.650
Don't act like that, mister!

00:05:50.650 --> 00:05:53.940
You would've died if we
hadn't picked up your pod!

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:17.340
Big Brother! What are you
doing with Daddy's clothes?!

00:06:17.340 --> 00:06:19.800
Who cares? We don't know
when he's coming back, anyway!

00:06:26.700 --> 00:06:28.220
If I make big money,

00:06:28.220 --> 00:06:31.440
I'll be able to send you to
a nice uptown school!

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:33.510
Who asked you to?!

00:06:40.300 --> 00:06:42.100
Here he comes!

00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:44.530
I brought them.

00:06:46.300 --> 00:06:48.950
Okay! Good job, Judau.

00:06:48.950 --> 00:06:51.330
You're really planning to just
go straight into the port?

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:52.830
Of course!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:56.160
The Argama's docked there.
I don't think you'll get in.

00:06:56.160 --> 00:06:58.460
What was that?
The Argama?

00:06:58.980 --> 00:07:02.220
Yeah, I saw the Argama
outside a little while ago.

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.390
They won't let a broken-down
trailer like this into the port.

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:14.590
What do we do, Mr. Yazan?

00:07:22.300 --> 00:07:23.950
Hey, speed up!

00:07:23.950 --> 00:07:25.600
Y-Yes, sir!

00:07:29.340 --> 00:07:31.560
What are you going to do?

00:07:55.330 --> 00:07:57.380
...the hell?!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:06.600
That looked painful.

00:08:08.340 --> 00:08:10.620
Now I see!

00:08:13.390 --> 00:08:16.620
Awesome! A new truck!

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.290
Well? Will this work?

00:08:18.290 --> 00:08:19.670
Yahoo!

00:08:19.670 --> 00:08:23.360
There's vegetables and
fruit in here! It's full of it!

00:08:41.790 --> 00:08:45.320
An AEUG woman.
Park alongside that one.

00:08:46.500 --> 00:08:48.530
All clear? Keep cool.

00:08:48.530 --> 00:08:50.770
We don't want to
draw attention to ourselves.

00:08:53.550 --> 00:08:55.230
It's heavy.

00:08:57.220 --> 00:08:59.710
Okay? Go back to the Argama.

00:08:59.710 --> 00:09:00.670
But...!

00:09:00.670 --> 00:09:03.380
I'll come right back as soon as
I take Kamille to the hospital.

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:04.780
'Kay.

00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:15.460
You the only one driving?

00:09:19.500 --> 00:09:20.230
Out!

00:09:20.230 --> 00:09:21.440
Stop it!

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:25.860
Not so rough with the girl!
This truck is carrying patients.

00:09:28.170 --> 00:09:30.120
Those are gate passes, right?

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:31.320
Here.

00:09:31.320 --> 00:09:32.740
Who's riding in back?

00:09:32.740 --> 00:09:34.740
I haven't picked anyone up yet.

00:09:34.740 --> 00:09:37.270
You, go look. Here.

00:09:38.430 --> 00:09:40.400
Out!

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:49.550
Anyone in there?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:53.540
Someone's sleeping.

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:31.930
Here, for a job well done.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.430
Oh! Are those oranges?

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:37.220
I hear the guys on the Argama
don't get much fresh produce.

00:10:37.220 --> 00:10:38.430
I suppose not.

00:10:38.430 --> 00:10:40.230
It's on floor B, right?

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:40.810
C.

00:10:40.810 --> 00:10:42.650
Oh, right!
My mistake.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.280
They're gone!

00:10:50.280 --> 00:10:52.160
We need to tell the Argama!

00:10:52.160 --> 00:10:52.910
Right!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.250
Think this'll work?

00:10:59.250 --> 00:11:02.330
It looks like they've taken a
lot of wounded to the hospital.

00:11:02.330 --> 00:11:04.320
The Argama's probably
down to a skeleton crew.

00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.840
Why'd you tell him there
was nobody in the back?

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:11.420
Because only a coward would
take an injured guy hostage, right?

00:11:11.420 --> 00:11:13.280
But a girl is just fine?

00:11:13.990 --> 00:11:18.660
You're no soldier. Besides,
you don't seem too upset by this.

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:21.890
Do you always do stuff
like this instead of going to school?

00:11:22.140 --> 00:11:25.940
What's so fun about doing nothing
but making your parents cry?

00:11:25.940 --> 00:11:28.940
And what are they going
to teach us at school?

00:11:28.940 --> 00:11:30.440
Like we have time for that?

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:32.450
We need to earn a living.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:35.950
Both my parents had to leave home
to look for work, thanks to the war.

00:11:35.950 --> 00:11:37.620
Your mom, too?

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:39.740
She left to work
in another colony.

00:11:39.740 --> 00:11:43.120
They send me an allowance,
but it's not enough to cover...

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:45.250
our air, power, and tax bills.

00:11:45.250 --> 00:11:47.280
I see...

00:12:12.540 --> 00:12:15.030
It'll be all we can do
to repair the Argama.

00:12:15.030 --> 00:12:17.780
There's no way we can
fix those mobile suits.

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:21.410
If we don't fix them here, there's no
telling when we can get it done!

00:12:21.410 --> 00:12:24.250
That money you gave us
will only buy so much.

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:30.460
This place isn't going to be safe forever!
If those guys from Axis come...

00:12:30.460 --> 00:12:32.050
We'll find some way
to pay you later.

00:12:32.050 --> 00:12:33.340
Trouble!

00:12:33.340 --> 00:12:34.260
Later!

00:12:34.260 --> 00:12:35.970
It's important!

00:12:35.970 --> 00:12:38.890
Um... It'll be clear
skies today. It'll be...

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:40.560
Just get to the point!

00:12:40.560 --> 00:12:42.000
I am! Jeez!

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:46.640
Um, attention, everyone on the Argama.
S-Sorry to interrupt your work,

00:12:46.640 --> 00:12:48.600
b-but, the truth is we kinda...

00:12:48.600 --> 00:12:50.650
This isn't a campaign speech!

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:52.660
Shut up, you jerk!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:55.150
W-We have taken a hostage!

00:12:55.330 --> 00:12:59.240
Unless you give us a mobile suit,
we can't guarantee the hostage's life!

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.950
Should've been more alert, pal!

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:06.370
Who are they?!

00:13:08.180 --> 00:13:10.040
Think you've got me?

00:13:12.270 --> 00:13:13.630
It's them!

00:13:13.630 --> 00:13:15.130
What about them?

00:13:15.130 --> 00:13:17.180
They grabbed Fa!

00:13:17.180 --> 00:13:18.130
What?!

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.930
We said it was important!

00:13:19.930 --> 00:13:21.720
Get everyone aboard out here!

00:13:21.720 --> 00:13:24.140
I repeat: give us a mobile suit!

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:27.770
Um... What was her name, again?

00:13:27.770 --> 00:13:31.020
Fi! Sorry, no! It's Fa!

00:13:31.020 --> 00:13:32.850
Fa Yuiry!

00:13:32.850 --> 00:13:35.530
It's Fa! Try to sound like you
know what you're doing!

00:13:35.530 --> 00:13:36.940
I know that!

00:13:36.940 --> 00:13:39.700
The hostage's name is Fa!
Fa Yuiry!

00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:42.530
This is why I didn't want
to let the Argama in here!

00:13:42.530 --> 00:13:44.660
Torres, bring a
worker out here!

00:13:44.660 --> 00:13:45.620
A-Aye, sir!

00:13:45.620 --> 00:13:46.410
Well?

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:48.710
We gotta save Fa with that!

00:13:50.060 --> 00:13:52.690
Unhook that crane! Hurry!

00:13:56.690 --> 00:14:00.930
Hey, kids! Help me any way you can!
You want your money, right?

00:14:02.280 --> 00:14:05.640
I'm not wild about using guns.
How do we help him?

00:14:05.640 --> 00:14:06.710
There's a way.

00:14:12.410 --> 00:14:14.480
We're not giving you
the Zeta Gundam!

00:14:16.080 --> 00:14:17.740
Try to throw straight!

00:14:17.740 --> 00:14:20.410
Is this doing any good at all?!

00:14:20.410 --> 00:14:22.240
Take that! And that!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:30.210
Huh? Why am I seeing that guy
from before in that mobile suit?

00:14:30.210 --> 00:14:32.540
There we go.
Keep it up!

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.540
What are they trying to do?

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:35.420
Oranges?

00:14:35.420 --> 00:14:36.920
Cabbage! Ow!

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:40.130
Guerillas have
infiltrated dock 1!

00:14:40.130 --> 00:14:43.050
Send reinforcements!
They're guerillas!

00:14:43.050 --> 00:14:44.510
- Ready?
- Yeah!

00:14:44.510 --> 00:14:46.560
Aim it up more!
Up! Now right!

00:14:46.560 --> 00:14:47.930
I know!

00:14:47.930 --> 00:14:49.390
Kids, don't!

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:53.400
Qum! Shinta!

00:14:58.080 --> 00:14:59.890
Shoot! Shoot!

00:15:00.590 --> 00:15:02.530
Stop that! Cut it out!

00:15:05.880 --> 00:15:08.180
Beecha, hold down the fort!

00:15:08.180 --> 00:15:10.330
That mobile suit...
It's a Gundam, right?

00:15:10.970 --> 00:15:13.950
I'm gonna try to steal it
without hurting anyone!

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:14.750
Judau!

00:15:16.890 --> 00:15:18.600
What? That boy...

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:19.990
Sorry!

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:24.760
Don't get hurt.
Okay...

00:15:28.530 --> 00:15:30.080
Shouldn't it open?

00:15:42.170 --> 00:15:44.260
What are you doing?!
Get out!

00:15:46.010 --> 00:15:46.620
Torres!

00:15:50.090 --> 00:15:53.460
Awesome!
This really is a Gundam!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:56.540
Why are you trying to steal a
mobile suit that barely works?!

00:15:56.540 --> 00:15:58.170
It'll be fine, really!

00:15:58.170 --> 00:16:01.630
As long as it can
move, and it's a Gundam,

00:16:01.630 --> 00:16:03.380
I CAN SELL IT
FOR A FORTUNE!

00:16:06.280 --> 00:16:08.970
This is the actual Zeta Gundam!

00:16:17.000 --> 00:16:19.670
Somehow, I think
I've got it figured out.

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.820
Okay... Just hang on, Leina!

00:16:24.820 --> 00:16:27.490
This'll buy your way
into an uptown school!

00:16:27.490 --> 00:16:29.660
Huh? Can't I close the hatch?

00:16:29.660 --> 00:16:32.500
Why not?
Is this the button?

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.160
Stop that, you kids!

00:16:34.370 --> 00:16:36.210
What's the big idea
of you doing this?!

00:16:36.210 --> 00:16:38.630
Don't shoot!
We weren't trying to kill anyone!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:44.670
You're not getting
that girl hostage!

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:47.930
Torres! Are you okay?!

00:16:47.930 --> 00:16:49.600
Yazan!
You're overdoing it!

00:16:49.800 --> 00:16:51.510
You're not getting the girl!

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:52.930
- Yazan!
- A petit mobile suit!

00:17:00.210 --> 00:17:01.320
Saegusa!

00:17:08.760 --> 00:17:12.410
He... He just
killed someone, didn't he?

00:17:12.410 --> 00:17:15.120
While we're trying
so hard to do it right...

00:17:15.120 --> 00:17:19.280
Dammit...
Dammit, you don't know what it's like!

00:17:20.130 --> 00:17:22.500
That's why I hate adults!

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.760
You don't care who gets hurt!

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:36.850
The kid got it moving?
I don't believe it.

00:17:36.850 --> 00:17:38.770
I'm taking the Zeta for myself!

00:17:43.750 --> 00:17:45.930
Here he comes!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:51.240
You think you can hit me?!

00:17:51.490 --> 00:17:52.450
What?!

00:17:52.450 --> 00:17:54.660
Gimme the Zeta!
Get out of there!

00:17:56.100 --> 00:17:57.540
The monitor's on.

00:17:57.540 --> 00:17:59.270
Get out or else!

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:08.920
What's the big idea?!
We just fixed that!

00:18:10.320 --> 00:18:11.340
Can it transform?

00:18:21.080 --> 00:18:22.510
I'm gonna crash!

00:18:32.420 --> 00:18:35.490
It's going into the colony!
Prepare for pursuit!

00:18:35.490 --> 00:18:37.120
Get us some ele-cars, Torres!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:39.460
Running away?!

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.330
I really don't mean to be!

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.710
He's reckless,
but he's still just a kid!

00:18:45.710 --> 00:18:47.450
I can handle this.

00:18:47.450 --> 00:18:50.870
Mr. Saegusa? Mr. Saegusa?

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:54.930
I swear I'll catch you, mister!

00:19:09.710 --> 00:19:12.450
I've got the better machine.
You won't get away!

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:28.210
I feel faint!

00:19:28.210 --> 00:19:30.070
Miss!

00:19:31.400 --> 00:19:33.370
Can't you go any faster?!

00:19:37.200 --> 00:19:39.790
He's doing well
for his first time.

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:43.480
He's going to land.
Can't I land, too?

00:19:52.380 --> 00:19:53.820
He's getting a power-up?

00:20:02.180 --> 00:20:03.770
What?

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:13.880
This'll let me
cut the Zeta's legs off!

00:20:16.240 --> 00:20:18.000
Are you serious?!

00:20:23.350 --> 00:20:25.850
Ow! Ow! Ow!

00:20:26.790 --> 00:20:29.270
You'll be roasted
inside that cockpit!

00:20:29.450 --> 00:20:31.610
I have the advantage in power!

00:20:31.610 --> 00:20:34.150
What good is power
if you can't use it well?

00:20:34.150 --> 00:20:37.070
Get out of there!
Otherwise, I'm coming for you!

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:39.200
There it is! Hurry!

00:20:41.390 --> 00:20:44.400
Are you that eager
to die, you little punk?!

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.040
It closed!

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.030
A layer of armor won't save you!

00:20:53.050 --> 00:20:55.510
This is a Gundam.

00:20:55.510 --> 00:20:58.590
If you're the Zeta Gundam,
then do something!

00:21:11.210 --> 00:21:15.280
Once again,
I'm beaten by a Gundam...

00:21:18.800 --> 00:21:21.180
The monitor died.

00:21:21.680 --> 00:21:23.240
Can't I open the hatch?

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.940
All set?

00:21:50.940 --> 00:21:52.520
Okay.

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:53.730
Are you hurt?

00:21:53.730 --> 00:21:55.280
Did you do that?

00:22:01.320 --> 00:22:04.370
What's...?! Hey!

00:22:13.980 --> 00:22:15.820
Those kids!

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:45.590 --> 00:23:48.450
The reason the Argama
took refuge inside the colony?

00:23:48.450 --> 00:23:52.750
I don't care about that.
All I want is to grab the Zeta!

00:23:52.750 --> 00:23:56.040
Wait, what? Because of
a marshmallow? No, wait.

00:23:56.040 --> 00:23:59.050
Mashymre Cello?
You gotta be kidding!

00:23:59.050 --> 00:24:02.880
I got dibs on the Zeta first!
I'm not letting you have it!

00:24:03.060 --> 00:24:05.300
Now get the hell out of here!

00:24:05.300 --> 00:24:09.600
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"The Knight of the Endra."

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:12.060
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.930
Next Time

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:12.930
THE KNIGHT OF THE ENDRA

